{"id":"4721","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4721_main_stratus-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>拍摄照片前几分钟，连续一层层云（雾已经持续到中午）破裂并抬升为为层云云片。图片中的云片是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波浪状的结构，将其识别为波状云类</span>。尽管波状云类似于波状层积云，但仔细观察它们的发展情况证实它们是波状层云，这种云类很少出现。作为进一步证据，云底相对较低，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">西部的高地仍然笼罩在雾中</span>。在图片的上半部分，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">可以看到一些高积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国巴特克罗伊茨纳赫县","latitude":"纬度: 49° 50' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 50' 32'' E","date":"04 November 2015 1618 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 6, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.8.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.8.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4721_syn_stratus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这张1200 UTC时的表面图（注意1 hPa等压线间隔）是拍摄照片前约3小时的情况，图中显示出中欧的两个高压中心，雾在山谷中持续了好几天。一股较弱的冷锋刚从西南方向穿过该区域，导致风力强度增加，温度逆温缓慢结束。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4721_upper_stratus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC时，在距离照片位置西南偏西40公里处的德国伊达尔 - 奥伯施泰因（WMO 10618）开展的探测显示表面与350米之间的低层逆温为6°C。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4721_sat_stratus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这张卫星图像是在照片前三个小时拍摄的，显示了在德国中西部山谷中徘徊的雾气。从西南方向接近弱锋，将中高层云带到该区域。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2015","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5481_main_stratus-undulatus-near-barcelona_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>有时层云呈现出不规则的云块状。图中，不规则的云块或云束有明显的波纹（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>）；因此，它们可确定为波状云类。这是一种比较罕见的层云。当地地形在海拔300-500米，在附近的探测（见高空探测）显示出大约1000米处的3 °C逆温。根据<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">塔前方的云束</span>，我们可估算其高度距地面约200米。波浪可能是由于冠盖逆温下方山丘上空的空气被迫上升和下降所致。在图片上方，可在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>看到扩散的飞机凝结尾迹。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙，巴塞罗那，瓦尔维德莱拉","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"20 November 2014 1115 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 6, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.8.5 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.8.5 1"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4474_main_stratus-nebulosus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>（注：1947年夏：日期和时间估算）</p>\n<p>由于该极地区域空气纯净，层云在 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span> 处的基底清晰可见；其高度恰好足以遮蔽<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">悬崖</span>顶部。云底高度并非绝对均匀；此外，该云层在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地平线</span>附近明显变薄。光学厚度的差异在 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span> 处显现出巨大而模糊的卷状结构，表明这是波状变种。</p></div>","copyright":"© F.A. Milan","location":"Thule, Greenland","latitude":"纬度: 76° 31' 60'' N","longitude":"经度: 68° 42' 0'' W","date":"15 July 1947 0700 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 6, CM= /, CH= /","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}